{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yD6npLCXtv1794532227.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>金管局向本港銀行投放76.6億港元流動性，是近七年以來最多。</p><p></p><p>金管局透過貼現窗，即是為銀行提供短期流動資金的窗口，向銀行借出76.6億港元流動性，以滿足個別銀行對短期資金需求，並維持港元市場穩定。金額創2019年12月以來最高紀錄。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.680073+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T03:52:19.616599+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:47:00.638646+00:00","content_hash":"ecfe18d9b05c46af8859a7a64d6965c43fec9131c9dd370aa8254ce0581e3d2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:53:46.680073+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}